WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 cc1cedf75df71450fa8e0da4a289c70e

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.520
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, tumekuwa tukitumia variable

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.760
kwa vitu vyenye maana fulani: umri wa mtu,

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.680
muda, rangi. Tumekuwa tukibadilisha variable, lakini

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.900
zimekuwa vitu visivyobadilika sana. Lakini mojawapo ya

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.320
matumizi ya kawaida sana ya variable katika kupanga programu

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.020
ni kufuatilia maendeleo yetu katika kazi nzima.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.280
Fikiria unajenga ukuta, kitu ambacho utakifanya

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.880
hivi punde. Katika maisha ya kila siku,

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.560
utakuwa unajua uko kwenye tabaka gani la matofali,

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.540
la chini au la juu,

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.380
la katikati, na utakuwa unajua

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.480
ni tofali gani unahitaji kuweka linalofuata,

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:40.240
la tatu, la nne, na kadhalika. Tunahitaji

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.240
kitu kama hicho pia katika ulimwengu wa kidijitali. Au

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:47.070
fikiria unajaribu kuunda bot ya kiotomatiki

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:50.220
ya Space Invaders. Inahitaji kujua

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.220
iko wapi kuanzia kushoto hadi kulia kwenye skrini.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.730
Katika kupanga programu, tunaita hili hali (<i>state</i> kwa Kiingereza),

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:59.840
kifupi cha kujua kitu kiko katika hali gani. Hali

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.510
inasaidia kujua kinachoendelea,

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.099
lakini inakuwa na manufaa hasa

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:08.250
tunapoiunganisha na masharti. Tukijenga

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.660
ukuta, tunahitaji kuangalia baada ya

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.780
kila tofali kuona kama tumeweka

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:16.160
tofali la mwisho kwenye mstari huo, na

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:17.520
ikiwa tumefanya hivyo, tunahitaji

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.200
kuhamia mstari unaofuata na kuanza tena

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:22.310
kuweka tofali la kwanza. Tukijenga bot yetu ya Space Invaders,

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.780
tunahitaji kuangalia kama tumefika

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.020
ukingo wa skrini kabla ya kusogea,

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.700
na kugeuza mwelekeo ikiwa tumefika. Na

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:32.360
mwelekeo huo ni hali pia, kumbukumbu ya kama

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.800
tunasafiri kushoto au kulia. Unapoendelea

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.600
mbele, hali itakuwa mojawapo ya

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:41.220
sehemu muhimu zaidi za kupanga programu: wazo la

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.100
kujua kitu kiko wapi, kiko katika hali gani,

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.140
au tumefikia hatua gani katika orodha yetu

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.960
ya kazi. Katika mazoezi mawili yanayofuata,

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:52.140
utatumia hali kujenga ukuta na

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.500
kucheza Space Invaders kwa kutumia mawazo

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:58.890
tuliyojadili hivi punde. Ni muhimu sana kuyagawanya

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:03.780
mazoezi haya katika hatua ndogo ndogo. Fikiria kwa makini

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.660
ni nini hasa unahitaji kujua

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.740
ili kuyatatua, mambo kama vile tabaka la matofali

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:09.360
ulilopo au nafasi ya

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:12.680
tofali la sasa. Fikiria kwa makini sheria

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:15.000
ambazo unahitaji kompyuta ifuate ili

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:18.780
kuweka ukuta wote. Hii ni kupanga programu halisi sasa.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.760
Hiki ndicho kitu

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.120
tunachofanya kila siku kama wasanidi programu. Mambo

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.700
yanazidi kuwa magumu, lakini pia

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.860
yanazidi kufurahisha. Mienendo hii huchukua muda kidogo

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:32.160
kuizoea mwanzoni, kwa hiyo

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.600
chukua muda wako, ufurahie, na tutaonana

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.320
hapa tena hivi punde.
